{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Comment vous appelez-vous ?", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "La famille de Pierre", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "Beginner", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Voici des mots qu'on entend dans des conversations sur la famille.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la m\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une femme qui a des enfants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La m\u00e8re de Pierre s'appelle Jos\u00e9phine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le p\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un homme qui a des enfants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Daniel est le p\u00e8re de Pierre.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la s\u0153ur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une femme ou une fille qui a les m\u00eames parents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Sa s\u0153ur est aimable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le fr\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un homme ou un gar\u00e7on qui a les m\u00eames parents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Exemple : Votre fr\u00e8re joue au football.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le chien", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un animal domestique tr\u00e8s commun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ton chien est mignon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cadet, cadette", "type": "name"}, {"content": "l'enfant le plus jeune d'une famille", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : H\u00e9l\u00e8ne est la s\u0153ur cadette de Pierre et Paul.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "les grands-parents", "type": "name"}, {"content": "les parents des parents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (nom m.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Nos grands-parents sont sympas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les adjectifs qualificatifs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Les adjectifs qualificatifs d\u00e9crivent des gens, des choses et des lieux.</br> Ils s'accordent en genre et en nombre avec le nom ou le pr\u00e9nom qu'ils d\u00e9terminent.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nombre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Genre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple 1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple 2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Singulier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Masculin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Mon fr\u00e8re est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le</span></span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Son p\u00e8re est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Il est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le</span></span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Il est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"F\u00e9minin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Ta s\u0153ur est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le</span></span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Votre m\u00e8re est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">e</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Elle est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le</span></span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Elle est <span class = \\\"strong\\\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">e</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pluriel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Masculin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Nos amis sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Leurs parents sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\"> d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Ils sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Ils sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\"> d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"F\u00e9minin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Ses amies sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Vos  grand-m\u00e8res sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\"> d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">es</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Elles sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\">dr\u00f4le<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">s</span>.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Elles sont <span class = \\\"strong\\\"> d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">es</span>.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">Notes</span></span></br><span class = \"bullet\">En r\u00e8gle g\u00e9n\u00e9rale, on ajoute un <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">-e</span></span> final \u00e0 la forme masculine des adjectifs qualificatifs pour marquer la forme f\u00e9minine : <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9</span> --> <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\"product-color-text\">e</span>.</span></br><span class = \"bullet\">Les adjectifs qualificatifs dont la forme masculine finit avec un <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">-e</span></span> ne changent pas au f\u00e9minin : <span class = \"strong\">dr\u00f4le</span></span>.</br><span class = \"bullet\">Pour marquer le pluriel des adjectifs qualificatifs on ajoute, en r\u00e8gle g\u00e9n\u00e9rale, un <span class = \"strong\"><span class=\"product-color-text\">-s</span></span> \u00e0 la forme masculine et f\u00e9minine du singulier : <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9</span> --> <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\"product-color-text\">s</span></span> ; <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\"product-color-text\">e</span></span> --> <span class = \"strong\">d\u00e9bord\u00e9<span class=\"product-color-text\">es</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "amoureux, amoureuse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui s'aiment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif et nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Mes grands-parents sont des amoureux.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant utilise une information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire et pr\u00e9cise dans des situations simples.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "L'apprenant compl\u00e8te des dialogues simples en choisissant ou en rajoutant un langage appropri\u00e9 en accord avec les fonctions communicatives du niveau.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple, le lexique et les expressions dans des conversations courtes au sujet de l'information personnelle.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "L'apprenant compl\u00e8te des dialogues simples en choisissant ou en rajoutant un langage appropri\u00e9 en accord avec les fonctions communicatives du niveau.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "L'apprenant compl\u00e8te des dialogues simples en choisissant ou en rajoutant un langage appropri\u00e9 en accord avec les fonctions communicatives du niveau.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "L'apprenant compl\u00e8te des dialogues simples en choisissant ou en rajoutant un langage appropri\u00e9 en accord avec les fonctions communicatives du niveau.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la grand-m\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "la m\u00e8re d'un des parents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ma grand-m\u00e8re habite dans une petite ville.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le grand-p\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le p\u00e8re d'un des parents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Leur grand-p\u00e8re s'appelle Luc.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le01ob06aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les nombres cardinaux de 1 \u00e0 29", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":6,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un, une\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"11\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"onze\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"21\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vingt et un\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"deux\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"cont